#: src/cli/build.md:1
msgid "The build command"
msgstr "构建命令"

#: src/cli/build.md:3
msgid "The build command is used to render your book:"
msgstr "构建命令用于渲染您的书籍："

#: src/cli/build.md:9
msgid ""
"It will try to parse your `SUMMARY.md` file to understand the structure of "
"your book and fetch the corresponding files. Note that this will also create "
"files mentioned in `SUMMARY.md` which are not yet present."
msgstr ""
"它会尝试解析你的 `SUMMARY.md` 文件，以了解你的书籍的结构，并获取相应的文件。"
"请注意，这也会创建在 `SUMMARY.md` 中提到的、但目前还不存在的文件。"

#: src/cli/build.md:13
msgid ""
"The rendered output will maintain the same directory structure as the source "
"for convenience. Large books will therefore remain structured when rendered."
msgstr ""
"为了方便起见，渲染后的输出将保持与源文件相同的目录结构。因此，大型书籍在渲染"
"后仍然会保持原有的结构。"

#: src/cli/build.md:16
msgid "Specify a directory"
msgstr "指定一个目录"

#: src/cli/build.md:18
msgid ""
"The `build` command can take a directory as an argument to use as the book's "
"root instead of the current working directory."
msgstr ""
"`build`命令可以接受一个目录作为参数，用作书籍的根目录，而不是当前的工作目录。"

#: src/cli/build.md:25
msgid "`--open`"
msgstr "`--open`"

#: src/cli/build.md:27
msgid ""
"When you use the `--open` (`-o`) flag, mdbook will open the rendered book in "
"your default web browser after building it."
msgstr ""
"当您使用 `--open` (`-o`) 标志时，在构建后，mdbook 会将在渲染后的书籍打开到您"
"的默认网页浏览器中。"

#: src/cli/build.md:30
msgid "`--dest-dir`"
msgstr "`--dest-dir`"

#: src/cli/build.md:32
msgid ""
"The `--dest-dir` (`-d`) option allows you to change the output directory for "
"the book. Relative paths are interpreted relative to the current directory. "
"If not specified it will default to the value of the `build.build-dir` key "
"in `book.toml`, or to `./book`."
msgstr ""
"选项 `--dest-dir` (`-d`) 允许您更改书籍的输出目录。相对路径是相对于当前目录进"
"行解释的。如果未指定，则默认使用 `book.toml` 中 `build.build-dir` 键的值，或"
"者使用 `./book`。"

#: src/cli/build.md:39
msgid ""
"_**Note:**_ _The build command copies all files (excluding files with `.md` "
"extension) from the source directory into the build directory._"
msgstr ""
"***注意：*** 构建命令会将所有文件（不包括带有 `.md` 扩展名的文件）从源目录复"
"制到构建目录中。"
